# LULU Excel Model — Never Break Valuation

Numeric source of truth: **`LULU/model18unaltered (12).xlsx`**. Base-case implied value must stay **~$133.64/sh** (DCF D56 after F9).

## Do not change

- Hardcoded blue inputs (rates, days, shares, prices) — exact floats from unaltered
- Cross-sheet formulas that feed DCF rows 42–56
- Source column hyperlinks on assumption rows

## Safe humanization only

| OK | Not OK |
|----|--------|
| Number **formats** (`0.0`, `0.0%`) so grid shows 6.3 / 2.3% | Script-rounding stored values (DSO 6.267… → 6.3 broke DCF) |
| Complete truncated Notes (8–15 words) | Deleting hardcodes or Source links |
| Blank Source on pure formula rows | Changing terminal g, Capex, share price |
| Fix broken column refs (e.g. TV recon E→D) | Running `strip_model_manual.py` on finished file |

